# LDAP outpost — stores no keys of its own. Its one secret, the outpost's API
# token, is the shared LDAP_OUTPOST_TOKEN, built into the env by env.nix. The
# (empty) secrets.sops.json is what makes the stack's env render at all, and
# must stay key-for-key equal to this file and
# tests/fixtures/stacks/ldap.sops.json.
